{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1819198319"}, "name":{"label":"dash boy09182"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-12T13:15:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.52"}, "id":{"label":"14659139391"}, "title":{"label":"Crazy letters"}, "content":{"label":"One time when I loaded the game, it said I clicked the button twice and I heard the clicking sound twice and it said the world of Minecraft is your village. Be careful to JX.below the JO line over the O. And other crazy letter like/ST 15 glitchy letters much more please fix that.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=479516143&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1609935589"}, "name":{"label":"VickyLovesGaming101"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-12T13:03:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.52"}, "id":{"label":"14659105105"}, "title":{"label":"BEST GAME EVER!!!!"}, "content":{"label":"When it comes to knock-offs, it’s not even a choice. I love Minecraft and have been playing for 4 years. I haven’t been here since the beginning, but it’s still my favorite game and Roblox can’t even compare to Minecraft. \nWith Minecraft’s  deeper backstory, awesome graphics, and incredible updates, it’s hard to get bored for long. Like really hard.\nThe Minecraft movie? Could have been better. I was expecting more on the backstory, like maybe just Steve and his adventures, and then he meets up with the other characters to help defeat the Ender dragon or something and teaches them the ways of Minecraft. Instead I got “oh, yeah, let’s combine 5 different versions of Minecraft into one, and add 10 billion other things that don’t exist while we’re at it.” My point is, I was expecting it to be in vanilla Minecraft. “A Minecraft Movie”? More like “A Modded Minecraft Movie,” if I’m being honest. Don’t get me wrong, it was good, but it could have been wayyyyyyyyyyy better. I’m still excited for the second one, though.\nBut yeah, if you are reading this, don’t listen to an6 other review given 3 stars or below. Minecraft deserves 4 stars AT LEAST, and that hardly does it justice. Minecraft players don’t play to rot in front of a screen all day. They play to connect, to build, to build MEMORIES. Here, we are much more than just your average games. We game with passion. \n     Thanks for reading.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=479516143&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
